---
import type { Lang } from '../i18n/ui';

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<article class="privacy">
  {
    lang === 'en' ? (
      <>
        <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
        <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: 3 August 2026</p>
        <p class="lede">
          This is a personal website. It does not use advertising trackers or client-side analytics.
          The site stores only the information needed to deliver a requested resume, display public
          responses, and handle abuse or privacy requests.
        </p>

        <h2>When you browse this site</h2>
        <p>
          Pages are delivered through Cloudflare and mirrored on GitHub Pages. Those providers may
          process connection data such as your IP address as part of delivering and securing the
          service. I do not send raw request logs to another database or retain IP addresses and
          User-Agent strings myself. Traffic measurement is limited to aggregate, server-side or
          edge data.
        </p>
        <p>
          No non-essential cookie is set on the public site. The theme preference is stored in your
          browser. A future protected resume service may use authentication cookies only as needed
          for that session; the public site does not set them today.
        </p>

        <h2>Comments and responses</h2>
        <p>
          Public replies received through Webmention may be shown with the author's name, source
          link, reply text, and a locally cached copy of the public avatar. Avatars are downloaded
          during the site build, converted to a static WebP file, and are not requested from the
          author's server by your browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          Reply text may be sent to OpenAI's moderation endpoint. No avatar, author name, email, IP
          address, or browser data is included in that request. A flagged reply is hidden; a service
          outage does not block the rest of the build. Public GitHub Actions run summaries only
          report aggregate counts for this step—not individual Webmention IDs, source URLs, or reply
          text.
        </p>
        <p>
          Giscus is not loaded until you select the GitHub tab below an article. At that point your
          browser connects to GitHub and Giscus, and their privacy terms apply. This choice is not
          remembered by this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Resume requests</h2>
        <p>
          Full-resume requests currently go to my ordinary contact mailbox as normal email. I reply
          manually. There is no live automated grant service, invite link, DMARC gate, download
          counter, or resume database on the public site yet. I do not store those requests outside
          my mailbox unless we continue the conversation by email.
        </p>
        <p>
          When an automated delivery service ships later, this notice will be updated before any
          automated entry points go live, including retention for grants, invite links, and download
          events.
        </p>

        <h2>Your requests</h2>
        <p>
          You may ask what identifiable data is held about your email address, ask for a correction,
          or request early deletion. Send the request to{' '}
          <a href="mailto:privacy@jimmychen.me">privacy@jimmychen.me</a>. Control of the relevant
          mailbox may be verified with an email one-time code; identity documents are not requested.
          I aim to respond within one month. Data needed for an active security incident, abuse
          investigation, or legal claim may be restricted and retained for that purpose.
        </p>

        <h2>Services used</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare</a> for delivery,
            security, email routing, access control, and storage.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
              GitHub
            </a>{' '}
            for source hosting, builds, the mirror site, and optional Giscus comments.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy/">OpenAI</a> for text-only
            Webmention moderation.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://webmention.io/privacy/">webmention.io</a> for receiving public
            Webmentions.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="scope">
          This notice follows GDPR data-minimisation and transparency principles as a practical
          baseline. It is not a claim of certification or a guarantee that every jurisdiction's law
          applies in the same way.
        </p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p class="kicker">隱私</p>
        <h1>隱私告知</h1>
        <p class="updated">最後更新：2026 年 8 月 3 日</p>
        <p class="lede">
          這是個人網站，不放廣告追蹤碼，也不使用 client-side
          analytics。本站只保存交付履歷、顯示公開回覆，以及處理濫用或隱私請求所需的資料。
        </p>

        <h2>瀏覽網站時</h2>
        <p>
          網頁主要由 Cloudflare 傳送，GitHub Pages 提供鏡像。這些服務在傳送及保護網站時，可能處理 IP
          address 等連線資料；本站不把 raw request log 匯出到其他 database，也不自行保存 IP address
          或 User-Agent。流量統計只使用 edge／server-side aggregate。
        </p>
        <p>
          公開網站不設定非必要 cookie。深淺色偏好只存在你的
          browser。未來若上線受保護履歷服務，可能會為登入狀態使用必要的 authentication
          cookie；公開站目前不會設定那些 cookie。
        </p>

        <h2>留言與站外回覆</h2>
        <p>
          透過 Webmention
          收到的公開回覆，可能連同作者名稱、來源連結、回覆文字與公開頭像顯示於文章下方。頭像只在
          build 時下載並轉成本站的靜態 WebP；訪客的 browser 不會再向原始頭像主機發出請求。
        </p>
        <p>
          回覆文字可能送到 OpenAI moderation endpoint 檢查；請求不含頭像、作者名稱、email、IP
          address 或 browser 資料。被標記的單則回覆會隱藏，服務中斷不會擋住其他文章或留言的
          build。公開的 GitHub Actions run summary 只報這個步驟的彙總數字，不會寫個別 Webmention
          ID、來源 URL 或回覆全文。
        </p>
        <p>
          Giscus 不會隨文章頁一起載入。只有你點選 GitHub 分頁後，browser 才會連線到
          GitHub／Giscus，後續資料處理由其隱私條款規範。本站不記住這項分頁選擇。
        </p>

        <h2>履歷申請</h2>
        <p>
          目前完整履歷申請走我平常的聯絡信箱，由我人工回覆。公開站上還沒有自動化的 grant
          服務、invite link、DMARC 閘門、下載計數或履歷 database。除非後續用 email
          繼續討論，否則這些申請不會被複製到 mailbox 以外的地方。
        </p>
        <p>
          之後若上線自動化交付，會先更新本告知，再開放自動化入口，並一併說明 grant、invite
          與下載事件的保留政策。
        </p>

        <h2>查詢、更正與刪除</h2>
        <p>
          你可以查詢本站保存了哪些與該 email 有關的可識別資料，也可以要求更正或提前刪除。請寄到{' '}
          <a href="mailto:privacy@jimmychen.me">privacy@jimmychen.me</a>。可能用 email OTP
          確認你能控制該
          mailbox，不要求提供身分證件；原則上會在一個月內回覆。若資料正用於安全事件、濫用調查或法律請求，會限制用途並只保留處理該事件所需的部分。
        </p>

        <h2>使用的外部服務</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/zh-tw/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare</a>
            ：網站傳送、安全防護、email routing、access control 與 storage。
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://docs.github.com/zh/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
              GitHub
            </a>
            ：source hosting、build、鏡像站與使用者主動開啟的 Giscus。
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://openai.com/zh-Hant/policies/privacy-policy/">OpenAI</a>：只含文字的
            Webmention moderation。
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://webmention.io/privacy/">webmention.io</a>：接收公開 Webmention。
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="scope">
          這份告知以 GDPR
          的資料最小化與透明原則作為實務基準，不表示本站取得任何認證，也不表示各地法律都以相同方式適用。
        </p>
      </>
    )
  }
</article>

<style>
  .privacy {
    max-width: var(--max-width-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-2xl);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .kicker {
    color: var(--color-seal);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    margin: var(--spacing-xs) 0 var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .lede {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: var(--text-lede);
  }

  h2 {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-seal);
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    margin: var(--spacing-xl) 0 var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-left: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  p,
  li {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: underline dotted;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-seal);
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--color-seal);
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-seal);
  }

  .scope {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
  }
</style>
